%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: DetectiveMonika1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189248
    - rid: 1790118809755189249
    - rid: 1790118809755189250
    - rid: 1790118809755189251
    - rid: 1790118809755189252
    - rid: 1790118809755189253
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (The Drunken Huntsman should be right over here...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189254
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189255
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, captain, it's good to see you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189256
    - rid: 1790118809755189257
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's a weird thing to say when we're here because someone's been murdered-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189258
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, Ivar, is that you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189259
    - rid: 1790118809755189261
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Weren't you at the Western Watchtower when the dragon attacked?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189260
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh- yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189262
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: My leg's been a bit singed ever since; I'm lucky you and the Jarl are
      kind enough to let me keep working.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189263
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah, I'm a big believer in worker's comp, ahaha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189264
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, about the murder.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189265
    - rid: 1790118809755189266
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Right, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189267
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: The victim, Anoriath, was reported as dead by his brother, Elrindir,
      at around sunrise this morning.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189268
    - rid: 1790118809755189269
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: The body was found in the room they share, right across from the entrance.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: When I checked the corpse's temperature, it was noticeably cooler than
      a person should be, but it still had some warmth.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Based on that, I'd put the time of the death anywhere between when he
      fell asleep and a few hours before Elrindir woke up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do we know the cause of death?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: On the body I found multiple open stab wounds, which I assume is the
      cause of death.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189323
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '(In summary: the victim died in the middle of night from... blood loss?)'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189324
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Was there any sign of a struggle or fight between the victim and the
      murderer?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189325
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Not that I'm aware of, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189326
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hm...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika glances to the side, noticing that there are two people seated
      at a table, despite this building being a crime scene.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, why are there two other people here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, these two are regulars here who happened to walk in while I was checking
      the body.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Since they're regulars, I ordered them to stick around in case they know
      anything.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118809755189330
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
